      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "3. In furtherance of order of this Court, the respondent No.4, namely-Smt. Santosh Kumari is present before this Court in person.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1078,
      "end": 1207,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Santosh Kumari",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1153,
          "end": 1167
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "4. On query made by this Court to respondent No.4 whether she is ready and willing to settle the dispute with the petitioners through mediation on which she replied that she does not want to go for mediation as she has been badly harassed by the petitioners and she further states that she wants justice.\n5. After arguing at some length, learned Counsel for the petitioners submits that he does not want to press this petition on merits and wants to withdraw the same with liberty to the petitioners to take appropriate remedy in available in law in appropriate proceedings.\n6. Learned A.G.A. for the State-respondents has no objection to the prayer made by learned Counsel for the petitioners.\n7. In view thereof, the present petition is consigned to record as withdrawn with liberty as prayed by learned Counsel for the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1208,
      "end": 2043,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "8. Interim order, if any, stands vacated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2044,
      "end": 2086,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
